            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit",
        "text": "Aahh... aaaaaahh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Talulah...! You... ngh...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Is that fire your doing!? You're the one who set them alight... guh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Alina, I'm sorry. This will surely mean even worse to come for the village. But I just couldn't stand it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I just couldn't stand this sort of..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...Alina?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Facing her, Talulah was taken aback. Alina met her gaze with an expression she'd never seen her wear before."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "There's a fire in your eyes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "I knew from the moment you came to this village, you'd never be willing just to stay here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You came from somewhere. Where you came from, you'll go back to. This village can't hold you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I won't go back. Don't look at me like that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "But within your eyes, truly, there's a fire."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You wanted to set something alight, burn it away, you thought none of this was how it should be, you bore it until you could bear it no more..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "It shouldn't have been now, Talulah. Not now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "The villagers are innocent. Your one flare of anger only served to hurt them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_082"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 0,
            "ystrength": 20,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 30,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit",
        "text": "What happened\u2014oh, God! What the hell is going on?! Who!? Who did this!?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "Talulah! Talulah! Run, now, run! And don't look back! Don't ever come back!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "Blessings, your Majesty, bless this girl like my daughter, bless her to live on, bless her so she can live on!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Talulah, we need to go!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "No... those hideous patrolmen!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "We're Infected, but none of the villagers are!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...What did you say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "I'm Infected too, Talulah. I'm Infected too."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
