            "fadetime": 3,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "*Pant*, *pant*... This is... where we'd planned to move. We had everything ready... but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "They... The old man was..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "We can't let them do this again... we can't let them..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "He saved you, saved me, saved the whole village."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You threw... his whole plan into disarray."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "What do you even mean? The villagers were the ones who\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...Wait. You mean the one who turned him in... was..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "It was his idea. That way, the Patrol wouldn't come again, and hopefully, that would've been that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "No matter how much strength you have, you can't resist the Patrol Unit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I can."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "And then? What if the Gendarmerie came? What if the city's garrisons and all the nobles' soldiers came?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "We just don't have the firepower. Once we've accumulated enough strength..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Because it's not right. It's not right! We can't just look on like this!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "All these wicked things right before our eyes, but we turn away, just to save ourselves?! That's not right!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...That's selfish. Heartless, even."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "If righteousness can only be upheld by greater and greater violence, how can it even be considered righteous?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "I can't answer these questions of yours, Talulah. You've studied more than I have, that I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "But someone died today in the village. And no more ought to die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "You're so clever. You can understand that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Now, go, Talulah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...I'll be back."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_078#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Tell yourself that, Talulah. Tell yourself that."
    },
